                    "message": "Issue #1: Typo in Test Case Name\n\n# Current code (test_policies_sub_menu.robot:217)\nVerify Error And Unauthorized Message When Readonly User Perform Toggle Policies\nFix Required:\n\nVerify Error And Unauthorized Message When Readonly User Performs Toggle Policies\n\nWhy: The verb \"Perform\" doesn't agree with the singular subject \"Readonly User\". Should be \"Performs\" for grammatical correctness and consistency with naming conventions."
