                    "message": "Issue #2: Erroneous Keyword Call in Documentation Section\n\n# Current code (test_policies_sub_menu.robot:218-220)\n```\n[Documentation]  Verify error and unauthorized message are displayed when a\n...  read-only user performs toggling operations on policies page.\nVerify_Error_And_Unauthorized_Message_When_Readonly_User_Perform_Toggle_Policies\n```\nFix Required:\n\n```\n[Documentation]  Verify error and unauthorized message are displayed when a\n...  read-only user performs toggling operations on policies page.\n[Setup]  Create Readonly User And Login To GUI\n```\nWhy: Missing [Tags] for the above."
